# Normalize text to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden proof-chain test vectors are deterministic artifacts: the
# generator writes LF, so pin them to LF in the working tree too. Without
# this, a Windows checkout rewrites them to CRLF and the next
# `npm run vectors` shows a whole-file diff that has nothing to do with
# the vectors actually changing.
#
# (Line endings do not affect verification itself — hashes are recomputed
# from re-canonicalized JSON values, never from the raw file bytes — but a
# noisy diff hides real changes, which is the thing these vectors exist to
# make visible.)
packages/*/vectors/*.json text eol=lf
